# Due Tomorrow from the command menu while editing an Upcoming entry moves it to Tomorrow and typing goes on in it.
file <<END
- Later @due({today+4})
- Early @due({today+1})
END
keys gU j <Enter> /
type due tom
keys <Enter>
type !
keys <Esc>
see - Later!
quit
saved <<END
- Later! @due({today+1})
- Early @due({today+1})
END
